## Keep indices current

- Update `philosophies/README.md` when adding or renaming a philosophy doc.
- Update `why-it-works/README.md` when adding meta rationale docs.
- For each persona under `system-prompts/<persona>/`, maintain a clear `README.md` that links to `system.prompt.md` and examples.
- For `conversation-logs/<topic>/`, maintain or add `README.md` summarizing the session and linking artifacts.
- For `design-specs/`, consider adding a top-level index if the list grows; ensure each spec is discoverable.

## Link integrity

- Prefer relative links.
- Verify new or updated links render on GitHub.
- When moving files, update all affected indices and cross-links.
